<title>BELGIUM: Belgian school closed in sandwich scare.</title>
<headline>Belgian school closed in sandwich scare.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>An infant school in Hoboken near the Belgian port city of Antwerp was evacuated on Thursday while bomb disposal experts examined a suspicious briefcase left nearby.</p>
<p>They found nothing more lethal than a packet of sandwiches.</p>
</text>
